---
import PlatformLayout from '../layouts/PlatformLayout.astro';
import { brand } from '../data/creative';
import { withBase } from '../lib/urls';
import { ArrowUpRight } from '@lucide/astro';
---
<PlatformLayout title="Capability meets vitality" description="Cook stands for capability. Dance stands for vitality. Discover the idea behind CookDance.">
  <header class="c-page-heading p-container"><span class="p-eyebrow">THE COOKDANCE IDEA</span><h1>Capability.<br /><em>With a life of its own.</em></h1><p>Cook = Capability. Dance = Vitality.</p></header>
  <section class="c-about p-container"><h2>{brand.slogan}</h2><div><p>CookDance brings practical creative capability and a lively point of view to ideas from around the world.</p><p>Today, our focus is digital creative production: AI-assisted video, cinematic storytelling, digital design, and product visualization. We begin with the idea and shape the production around it.</p><p>Our long-term mission is to connect China’s creative and manufacturing capabilities with people around the world, through thoughtful products and services. This first chapter starts with digital creativity.</p><p>We value clear conversations and honest presentation. Service directions and visual studies are labeled as such; we do not present them as commissioned client work.</p><a class="c-button" href={withBase('/contact/')}>Start a conversation <ArrowUpRight size={16} /></a></div></section>
</PlatformLayout>